<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>New Email Added</title>
  <style>
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

    body {
      background-color: #f4f4f4;
      font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      color: #333333;
    }

    .wrapper {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 40px auto;
      background-color: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 8px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
    }

    .header {
      background-color: #f50;
      padding: 32px 40px;
    }

    .header h1 {
      color: #ffffff;
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    }

    .body {
      padding: 40px;
    }

    .body p {
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.7;
      color: #555555;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .email-box {
      background-color: #fff8f5;
      border-left: 4px solid #f50;
      border-radius: 4px;
      padding: 16px 20px;
      margin: 24px 0;
      font-size: 15px;
      color: #333333;
      word-break: break-all;
    }

    .email-box strong {
      display: block;
      font-size: 12px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.8px;
      color: #f50;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    .alert-box {
      background-color: #fff3cd;
      border: 1px solid #ffc107;
      border-radius: 4px;
      padding: 16px 20px;
      margin: 24px 0;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #856404;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .cta-button {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 8px;
      padding: 12px 28px;
      background-color: #f50;
      color: #ffffff;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .divider {
      border: none;
      border-top: 1px solid #eeeeee;
      margin: 32px 0;
    }

    .footer {
      padding: 0 40px 40px;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #999999;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .footer a {
      color: #f50;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrapper">

    <div class="header">
      <h1>SoundCloud Clone</h1>
    </div>

    <div class="body">
      <p>Hi <strong>{{display_name}}</strong>,</p>

      <p>
        We're letting you know that a new email address has been added to your account.
      </p>

      <div class="email-box">
        <strong>New Email Added</strong>
        {{newEmail}}
      </div>

      <div class="alert-box">
        ⚠️ If you did not add this email address, your account may be compromised.
        Please secure your account immediately by changing your password.
      </div>

      <p>
        You can review and manage all email addresses linked to your account from your account settings.
      </p>

    </div>

    <hr class="divider" />

    <div class="footer">
      <p>
        This is an automated security notification. Please do not reply to this email.
      </p>
      <p style="margin-top: 8px;">
        If you need help, contact our <a href="#">support team</a>.
      </p>
      <p style="margin-top: 16px;">
        © {{year}} SoundCloud Clone. All rights reserved.
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>
</body>
</html>